song "Lab Notes: The Cold Plate" 120 4/4 Am fps=30 seed=11 tail=3 video=ColdPlate:1890
inst bass(cutoff=700)
chords Am F C G /2
motif m1 deg oct=5 "0/4 2 4 3 | 2/2 0"
